\\",\\\"expected\\\":\\\"\" << JsonEscape(TextFormatter<T>::Get(expected))\n         << \"\\\"}\" << endl;\n    if (!passed) abort();\n}\n\nint main() {\n    {\n        vector<int> nums = {1, 2, 3};\n        Solution().nextPermutation(nums);\n        CheckCase(1, nums, vector<int>{1, 3, 2});\n    }\n    {\n        vector<int> nums = {3, 2, 1};\n        Solution().nextPermutation(nums);\n        CheckCase(2, nums, vector<int>{1, 2, 3});\n    }\n    {\n        vector<int> nums = {1, 1, 5};\n        Solution().nextPermutation(nums);\n        CheckCase(3, nums, vector<int>{1, 5, 1});\n    }\n    return 0;\n}',1,131072),(15,'最长有效括号','困难','给你一个只包含左圆括号和右圆括号的字符串 s。\n\n请找出其中最长的、格式正确并且连续的括号子串，并返回这个子串的长度。\n\n示例 1：\n\n输入：\ns = \"(()\"\n\n输出：\n2\n\n解释：\n最长有效括号子串是 \"()\"。\n\n示例 2：\n\n输入：\ns = \")()())\"\n\n输出：\n4\n\n解释：\n最长有效括号子串是 \"()()\"。\n\n示例 3：\n\n输入：\ns = \"\"\n\n输出：\n0\n\n提示：\n\n字符串长度在 0 到 30000 之间。\n字符串只包含左圆括号和右圆括号。','#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <vector>\n#include <stack>\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n    int longestValidParentheses(string s) {\n        // write code here\n    }\n};','#ifndef COMPILER_ONLINE\n#include \"header.cpp\"\n#endif\n#include <cstdlib>\n#include <sstream>\n\nstatic string JsonEscape(const string& text) {\n    string out;\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < text.size(); ++i) {\n        char ch = text[i];\n        switch (ch) {\n        case \'\\\\\': out += \"\\\\\\\\\"; break;\n        case 34: out += char(92); out += char(34); break;\n        case \'\\n\': out += \"\\\\n\"; break;\n        case \'\\r\': out += \"\\\\r\"; break;\n        case \'\\t\': out += \"\\\\t\"; break;\n        default: out += ch; break;\n        }\n    }\n    return out;\n}\n\ntemplate <class T>\nstruct TextFormatter {\n    static string Get(const T& value) {\n        ostringstream out;\n        out << value;\n        return out.str();\n    }\n};\n\ntemplate <class T>\nstatic void CheckCase(int index, const T& actual, const T& expected) {\n    bool passed = actual == expected;\n    cerr << \"__OJ_CASE__{\\\"case\\\":\" << index\n         << \",\\\"passed\\\":\" << (passed ? \"true\" : \"false\")\n         << \",\\\"actual\\\":\\\"\" << JsonEscape(TextFormatter<T>::Get(actual))\n         << \"\\\",\\\"expected\\\":\\\"\" << JsonEscape(TextFormatter<T>::Get(expected))\n         << \"\\\"}\" << endl;\n    if (!passed) abort();\n}\n\nint main() {\n    CheckCase(1, Solution().longestValidParentheses(\"(()\"), 2);\n    CheckCase(2, Solution().longestValidParentheses(\")()())\"), 4);\n    CheckCase(3, Solution().longestValidParentheses(\"\"), 0);\n    return 0;\n}',1,131072);
